The Painting	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Painting","wikiPath":"/The_Painting","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"South Qeynos","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Danaria Hollin","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Platinum"},{"text":"Faction","item":"Faction","wikiPath":"/Faction"}],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Craftkeepers"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Heretics"}," has been adjusted by -1."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Guard of Erudin"}," has been adjusted by 5."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["You can do one of two things with this Boat Beacon. Turn it in to Palatos Kynarn, or to Lenka Stoutheart (found occasionally in the Grub 'n Grog Tavern at the Freeport dock). Upon turning it into Palatos, the quest is over."],"steps":[{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Craftkeepers"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Heretics"}," got worse."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Guard of Erudin"}," got better."],"steps":[]}]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Wolves of the North"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Shamen of Justice"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Merchants of Halas"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Steel Warriors"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Craftkeepers"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Council of Erudin"}," got better."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"Heretics"}," got worse."],"steps":[]},{"parts":["Your faction standing with ",{"title":"High Guard of Erudin"}," got better."],"steps":[]}],"card":{"title":"The Painting","lines":["Minimum Level: 10","Classes: All","Related Zones: East Commonlands, East Freeport","Related NPCs: Lenka Stoutheart, Nesin Tapper, Palatos Kynarn, Svinal Wyspin"]},"links":["Qeynos","Danaria Hollin","East Commonlands","Freeport","Lenka Stoutheart","Nesin Tapper","Palatos Kynarn","Svinal Wyspin","Faction","Capt. Orlin's Spiced Ale","Craftkeepers","High Council of Erudin","Heretics","High Guard of Erudin","Bronto Thudfoot","Wolves of the North","Shamen of Justice","Merchants of Halas","Steel Warriors"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Danaria Hollin","text":"Greetings! Nice to meet someone with manners. I do not see how you people stand to live in this madhouse of ruffians. I would have left weeks ago if I were not waiting for a delivery. Oh, well. Nice to have met you."},{"npc":"Danaria Hollin","text":"I am in Qeynos to meet up with a fellow Erudite coming from Freeport. He is two weeks late and I fear the worst. I shall need to hire some lackey to go to Freeport to find him."},{"npc":"Danaria Hollin","text":"Yes, that might work. Please go to Freeport and find him. His name is Palatos Kynarn. Tell him that Danaria has sent you for the painting. And be quick about it! Thank you."},{"npc":"Palatos Kynarn","text":"What do you want? Can't you see that I wish to be alone?! I have no need nor desire to speak with anyone. I have a minor dilemma to ponder and the only person I wish to speak with is the [captain]."},{"npc":"Palatos Kynarn","text":"If you are working for Danaria, you have been misguided. You will go back to her empty handed. Now leave. The [captain] and I have some business to discuss."},{"npc":"Palatos Kynarn","text":"Ahh.. I.. Need help.. You.. take this.. Go build.. boat beacon. Ask gnomes about.. boat beacon. They know how.. Then bring back.. Unnnhh!! Prexus help me!! I will never drink again."},{"npc":"Svinal Wyspin","text":"Welcome, welcome, welcome! This is the Emporium. If we don't have it, we can get it!!"},{"npc":"Svinal Wyspin","text":"What!!? Looking for a boat beacon? We may be getting one from Ak'Anon in about a year. You can always try to make one. Find a greater lightstone, a metal disk and a copper band. If you have a beacon mount, go to a forge and combine them all. It's not that hard, but it's not that easy, either."},{"npc":"Palatos Kynarn","text":"Thanks.. That saved me a lot of money. Now I can spend more time with the captain before I give this back to Lenka Stoutheart. Here is a little so...mething."},{"npc":"Lenka Stoutheart","text":"Oh!! You must work for that Erudite named Palatos. I guess he won't have to spend anymore money drinking in Freeport. Here. Here is the portrait I kept until he could get me a new boat beacon."},{"npc":"Palatos Kynarn","text":"Wise decision!! Little reward for a large deed. Bye."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24T04:31:50.992Z","outOfEra":false}
